Rule 1 (elementwise broadcasting-compatible shapes for input and other)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= (ndim(v_1) = ndim(v_2)) ∧ (if ndim(v_1) = 0 then true else ∀ i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : (shape(v_1, i) = shape(v_2, i)) ∨ (shape(v_1, i) = 1) ∨ (shape(v_2, i) = 1))
